# A relative EXTRA_DATA_DIR resolves against the binary's own directory, so CMake links it
# one level above the build directory (the AppImage's ../share/ja2 lands here). Generated by
# the configure, never committed: see the EXTRA_DATA_DIR block in CMakeLists.txt.
/share/
/*/CMakeUserPresets.json
docs-generated/
# The roadmap page and its snapshot are generated output: `python tools/dev.py
